abstract: >-
  Reproducibility materials for Stochastic Morphological pi-Mixture Kernels:
  Identifiability, Topological Stability, and Output-Space Learning. The package
  contains code, frozen clean inputs, fitted models, numerical outputs, figures,
  mathematical checks, and supplementary documentation for the JVCIR submission.
